<workout_file>
    <author>Domestique Library</author>
    <name>Neuromuscular (57min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 10min ramp from 50% to 65% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 65% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 80% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 65% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 80% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 65% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 80% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 65% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 80% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 65% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 80% FTP | Steady: 3min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 10min @ 81% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 150% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 170% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 50% FTP | Steady: 15s @ 200% FTP | Steady: 45s @ 50% FTP | Steady: 10s @ 200% FTP | Steady: 5min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 10min @ 81% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 150% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 170% FTP | Steady: 30s @ 50% FTP | Steady: 15s @ 200% FTP | Steady: 45s @ 50% FTP | Steady: 10s @ 200% FTP | Cooldown: 5min ramp from 65% to 40% FTP</description>
